{"k":"quad","t":"Quadratic Equations","cls":"11","u":"Algebra","s":[["Roots",[{"q":"Quadratic formula","f":"ax^2+bx+c=0\\ \\Rightarrow\\ x=\\frac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{b^2-4ac}}{2a}","n":"$a\\ne0$. $D=b^2-4ac$.","d":"$ax^2+bx+c=0 \\Rightarrow x^2+\\frac bax=-\\frac ca \\Rightarrow \\left(x+\\frac b{2a}\\right)^2=\\frac{b^2-4ac}{4a^2}$; take square roots."},{"q":"Sum and product of roots","f":"\\alpha+\\beta=-\\frac ba,\\qquad \\alpha\\beta=\\frac ca","d":"$a(x-\\alpha)(x-\\beta)=ax^2-a(\\alpha+\\beta)x+a\\alpha\\beta$; compare coefficients."},{"q":"Difference of roots","f":"|\\alpha-\\beta|=\\frac{\\sqrt D}{|a|}","d":"$(\\alpha-\\beta)^2=(\\alpha+\\beta)^2-4\\alpha\\beta=\\frac{b^2-4ac}{a^2}$."},{"q":"Quadratic with given roots","f":"x^2-(\\alpha+\\beta)x+\\alpha\\beta=0"},{"q":"Nature of roots (real coefficients)","f":"D>0:\\ \\text{real, distinct};\\quad D=0:\\ \\text{real, equal}\\ \\left(-\\tfrac b{2a}\\right);\\quad D<0:\\ \\text{complex conjugates}","n":"If $a,b,c\\in\\mathbb Q$ and $D$ is a perfect square, roots are rational. Irrational roots of a rational quadratic come in pairs $p\\pm\\sqrt q$."},{"q":"Useful symmetric expressions","f":"\\alpha^2+\\beta^2=(\\alpha+\\beta)^2-2\\alpha\\beta,\\qquad \\alpha^3+\\beta^3=(\\alpha+\\beta)^3-3\\alpha\\beta(\\alpha+\\beta)","n":"$\\alpha^2-\\beta^2=(\\alpha+\\beta)(\\alpha-\\beta)$; $\\alpha^4+\\beta^4=(\\alpha^2+\\beta^2)^2-2\\alpha^2\\beta^2$."},{"q":"Newton's sums for a quadratic","f":"S_n=\\alpha^n+\\beta^n:\\quad aS_{n+2}+bS_{n+1}+cS_n=0","d":"$a\\alpha^2+b\\alpha+c=0$; multiply by $\\alpha^n$; same for $\\beta$; add."}]],["Common roots",[{"q":"Condition for one common root","f":"(c_1a_2-c_2a_1)^2=(a_1b_2-a_2b_1)(b_1c_2-b_2c_1)","n":"For $a_1x^2+b_1x+c_1=0$ and $a_2x^2+b_2x+c_2=0$.","d":"Cross-multiplication: $\\frac{\\alpha^2}{b_1c_2-b_2c_1}=\\frac{\\alpha}{c_1a_2-c_2a_1}=\\frac1{a_1b_2-a_2b_1}$; square the middle ratio and equate."},{"q":"Condition for both roots common","f":"\\frac{a_1}{a_2}=\\frac{b_1}{b_2}=\\frac{c_1}{c_2}"}]],["Graph and sign of the quadratic",[{"q":"Vertex of $y=ax^2+bx+c$","f":"\\left(-\\frac b{2a},\\ -\\frac D{4a}\\right)","n":"Minimum value $-\\frac D{4a}$ if $a>0$; maximum if $a<0$.","d":"$ax^2+bx+c=a\\left(x+\\frac b{2a}\\right)^2-\\frac D{4a}$."},{"q":"Quadratic always positive / negative","f":"ax^2+bx+c>0\\ \\forall x\\iff a>0,\\ D<0;\\qquad <0\\ \\forall x\\iff a<0,\\ D<0","n":"Use $\\ge0$ with $D\\le0$ for non-strict."},{"q":"Range of quadratic on an interval","f":"\\text{check } f(p),\\ f(q)\\ \\text{and } f\\!\\left(-\\tfrac b{2a}\\right)\\text{ if } -\\tfrac b{2a}\\in[p,q]"}]],["Location of roots",[{"q":"Both roots greater than $k$","f":"D\\ge0,\\quad af(k)>0,\\quad -\\frac b{2a}>k"},{"q":"Both roots less than $k$","f":"D\\ge0,\\quad af(k)>0,\\quad -\\frac b{2a}<k"},{"q":"$k$ lies between the roots","f":"af(k)<0","n":"Then $D>0$ automatically."},{"q":"Exactly one root in $(k_1,k_2)$","f":"f(k_1)f(k_2)<0"},{"q":"Both roots in $(k_1,k_2)$","f":"D\\ge0,\\quad af(k_1)>0,\\quad af(k_2)>0,\\quad k_1<-\\frac b{2a}<k_2"},{"q":"$k_1,k_2$ both between the roots","f":"af(k_1)<0,\\quad af(k_2)<0"},{"q":"Roots of opposite signs","f":"\\frac ca<0"},{"q":"Both roots positive","f":"D\\ge0,\\quad -\\frac ba>0,\\quad \\frac ca>0"}]],["Transformation of equations",[{"q":"Roots changed to $\\frac1\\alpha$","f":"\\text{replace } x\\to\\frac1x:\\quad cx^2+bx+a=0"},{"q":"Roots changed to $-\\alpha$, $k\\alpha$, $\\alpha+k$","f":"x\\to -x,\\qquad x\\to\\frac xk,\\qquad x\\to x-k"}]],["Higher degree",[{"q":"Relations between roots and coefficients (cubic)","f":"ax^3+bx^2+cx+d=0:\\ \\ \\sum\\alpha=-\\frac ba,\\quad\\sum\\alpha\\beta=\\frac ca,\\quad\\alpha\\beta\\gamma=-\\frac da"},{"q":"Relations for degree $n$ (Vieta)","f":"\\sum\\alpha_i=-\\frac{a_1}{a_0},\\quad\\sum\\alpha_i\\alpha_j=\\frac{a_2}{a_0},\\ \\dots,\\ \\prod\\alpha_i=(-1)^n\\frac{a_n}{a_0}","n":"For $a_0x^n+a_1x^{n-1}+\\cdots+a_n=0$."},{"q":"Biquadratic relations","f":"ax^4+bx^3+cx^2+dx+e=0:\\ \\sum\\alpha=-\\tfrac ba,\\ \\sum\\alpha\\beta=\\tfrac ca,\\ \\sum\\alpha\\beta\\gamma=-\\tfrac da,\\ \\alpha\\beta\\gamma\\delta=\\tfrac ea"},{"q":"Descartes' rule of signs","f":"\\#\\text{positive roots}\\le\\text{sign changes in } f(x);\\qquad \\#\\text{negative roots}\\le\\text{sign changes in } f(-x)","n":"The difference is an even number."},{"q":"Remainder and factor theorem","f":"f(x)\\div(x-a)\\ \\text{leaves remainder } f(a);\\qquad f(a)=0\\iff(x-a)\\mid f(x)"},{"q":"Repeated root condition","f":"\\alpha\\ \\text{is a root of multiplicity } r \\iff f(\\alpha)=f'(\\alpha)=\\cdots=f^{(r-1)}(\\alpha)=0,\\ f^{(r)}(\\alpha)\\ne0"}]],["Expressions in two variables",[{"q":"Condition for $ax^2+2hxy+by^2+2gx+2fy+c$ to factor into two linear factors","f":"\\Delta=abc+2fgh-af^2-bg^2-ch^2=0","n":"Equivalently $\\begin{vmatrix}a&h&g\\\\h&b&f\\\\g&f&c\\end{vmatrix}=0$."},{"q":"Range of a rational expression $y=\\frac{a_1x^2+b_1x+c_1}{a_2x^2+b_2x+c_2}$","f":"\\text{cross-multiply to a quadratic in } x;\\ \\text{require } D\\ge0\\ \\text{for real } x"}]]]}